## 4. Software Security Testing

| Testing Type | Method | Key Focus |
|---|---|---|
| **Static Code Analysis** | Reviews code without executing it (white-box) | Finds syntax and logic flaws before runtime |
| **Dynamic Code Analysis** | Executes running code while feeding it inputs | Evaluates software behavior in real time |
| **Fuzzing** | Sends invalid, random, or malformed data to an application | Uncovers input validation flaws, memory leaks, and error-handling bugs |

